(text "INTERFACES ONLY - charger, boost and load cutoff not implemented.\nJ2 terminals must be protected pack P+/P-. Check vendor polarity.\nJ3 sensor physically attached to pack; NTC curve and divider pending.\nFootprints and connector current ratings pending mechanical selection.\nGND_HMI must remain isolated from metrology GND / VN_SENSE.\nNo 13-hour autonomy requirement. Capacity and runtime pending." (at 114.3 50.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4ccd0800-c686-4873-9f4a-7701d6d272cc"))
